#####################################################################
Date: Tue, 4 Feb 2025 20:00:00 +0000
From: Theo Anderson <theo.anderson@sky.uk>
Subject: [PATCH] Prevent the gatt-server from registering certain opcodes.

This will cause the server to respond with ATT Error Response (Request Not Supported).
This is needed to PASS GATT/SR/UNS/BI-01-C [Unsupported ATT Requests on Server].

Source: Sky
License:
Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Theo Anderson <theo.anderson@sky.uk>
#####################################################################
